{"id":"58b3abba4b6ac225","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free.md","title":"可计算可迹性蕴含超免疫自由","display":"thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free — 可计算可迹性蕴含超免疫自由","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free","aliases":["43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free"],"display":"thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free — 可计算可迹性蕴含超免疫自由","depends_on":["[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"Obs.16.1.3, printed p.481 / PDF p.501","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free — 可计算可迹性蕴含超免疫自由"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Obs.16.1.3, printed p.481 / PDF p.501"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给每个全函数f≤TA选规范有限集迹D_{g(n)}；其最大值可统一计算且逐点大于等于f(n)，所以每个A可计算函数均有可计算支配。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1077,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-387","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-traceable-hyperimmune-free]] — 可计算可迹性蕴含超免疫自由"}],"outgoing":["abd2ac3cf0e63c86","df08310d02ee0072"]}